      "headingRaw": "Five-character-regular-verseLiBaiTHOUGHTSOFOLDTIMEFROMANIGHT-MOORINGUNDERMOUNTNIU-ZHU",
      "translationRaw": "Thisnighttothewestoftheriver-brimThereisnotonecloudinthewholebluesky，AsIwatchfrommydecktheautumnmoon，VainlyrememberingoldGeneralXie。。。。Ihavepoems；Icanread；Heheardothers，butnotmine。。。。TomorrowIshallhoistmysail，Withfallenmaple-leavesbehindme。",
